   "url": "https://www.bis.gov/news-updates",
   "text": "The Trump Administration will pursue a bold, inclusive strategy to American SI technology with trusted foreign countries around the world, while keeping the technology out of the hands of our adversaries. At the same time, we reject the Biden Administration’s attempt to impose its own ill-conceived and counterproductive SI policies on the American people.",
